IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DEPOSIT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER DEPOSIT AMOUNT:"
    ACCEPT AMOUNT

    IF AMOUNT >= 1 AND AMOUNT <= 500000
        DISPLAY "VALID"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "INVALID"
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
